{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The gameplay shown is from an early stage of development.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Umbra's Cauldron</strong> is a 2D card-stacking game in which you take on the role of an alchemist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Had I mixed a <strong>bloodroot</strong> or a drop of <strong>honey</strong> into my tincture? Oh well, it'll all go <strong>wrong</strong>... Or at least that's what you thought. Now you find yourself as a <strong>book</strong> in a <strong>magical world</strong>, trying to regain your original form with the help of powerful <strong>potions</strong> and lots of <strong>unexplored</strong> recipes. But don't worry, you're not alone. Crawly critters will be by your side on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you be able to discover all the <strong>card</strong>, fill your empty <strong>pages</strong> and transform back?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Stack Cards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Draw, stack and combine cards to collect resources, discover recipes and brew unique potions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3118490/extras/Gameplay_GIF.gif?t=1743604595\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Living Book</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have turned into a book. All the cards you discover and recipes you find are written down on your pages. If you fill your empty pages completely, you might find a way to turn back.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Everything is a card</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Beautiful illustrations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Countless recipes to discover and explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crawling bugs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"ht